{"id":"59e94f1adddc4fdd","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-tableau-procedure.md","title":"GL Tableau Rewrite Procedure","display":"df-gl-tableau-procedure — GL Tableau Rewrite Procedure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-tableau-procedure","aliases":["89-df-gl-tableau-procedure"],"display":"df-gl-tableau-procedure — GL Tableau Rewrite Procedure","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic]]","[[89-df-modal-subformula]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-tableau-procedure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-tableau-procedure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-tableau-procedure — GL Tableau Rewrite Procedure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b0e5598f570a6835\" href=\"?note=b0e5598f570a6835\" title=\"89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic\">89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"71b4f56d6213ff7c\" href=\"?note=71b4f56d6213ff7c\" title=\"89-df-modal-subformula\">89-df-modal-subformula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 的下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 沿用真值树语言标签；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,U\">\\(T,U\\)</span> 遍历该已定义语言。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=(\\Gamma,E,\\mathcal U)\">\\(b=(\\Gamma,E,\\mathcal U)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)\\setminus E\">\\(k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)\\setminus E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\mathbin{\\frown}s\">\\(\\Gamma\\mathbin{\\frown}s\\)</span> 为有限序列连接；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b[s;k]=(\\Gamma\\mathbin{\\frown}s,E\\cup\\{k\\},\\mathcal U)\">\\(b[s;k]=(\\Gamma\\mathbin{\\frown}s,E\\cup\\{k\\},\\mathcal U)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec D_b\">\\(\\vec D_b\\)</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 中位置顺序收集所有形如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box D\">\\(\\Box D\\)</span> 的内容 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>（允许重复）。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(C,b)=\\langle\\neg C,\\Box C\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle D,\\Box D\\mid D\\in\\vec D_b\\rangle\">\\(\\sigma(C,b)=\\langle\\neg C,\\Box C\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle D,\\Box D\\mid D\\in\\vec D_b\\rangle\\)</span>，后一序列逐对连接。</li>\n<li>分支出现地址 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Br}(T)\">\\(\\mathsf{Br}(T)\\)</span> 递归为外层地址 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle j\\rangle\">\\(\\langle j\\rangle\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle j,u\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}a\">\\(\\langle j,u\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}a\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Br}(\\mathcal U_j(u))\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Br}(\\mathcal U_j(u))\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T|a\">\\(T|a\\)</span> 为该处记录；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T[a:=\\beta]\">\\(T[a:=\\beta]\\)</span> 在该处以有限分支序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 替换单个分支，保留其他记录。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}procedure}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{PReady}(b)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)\\setminus E\\;\n\\neg\\exists B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n(\\Gamma(k)=(B\\land C)\\lor\\Gamma(k)=\\neg(B\\land C)\\lor\\Gamma(k)=\\neg\\neg B),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Rules}(b)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{\\langle b[\\langle B,C\\rangle;k]\\rangle\\mid\\Gamma(k)=B\\land C\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle b[\\langle\\neg B\\rangle;k],b[\\langle\\neg C\\rangle;k]\\rangle\\mid\\Gamma(k)=\\neg(B\\land C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle b[\\langle B\\rangle;k]\\rangle\\mid\\Gamma(k)=\\neg\\neg B\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle(\\Gamma,E\\cup\\{k\\},\\mathcal U\\mathbin{\\frown}\n\\langle\\langle(\\sigma(C,b),\\varnothing,\\langle\\rangle)\\rangle\\rangle)\\rangle\n\\mid\\Gamma(k)=\\neg\\Box C\\land\\mathsf{PReady}(b)\\},\\\\\nT\\Rightarrow U&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists a\\in\\mathsf{Br}(T)\\ \\exists\\beta\\in\\mathsf{Rules}(T|a)\\\n(\\mathsf{Open}(T|a)\\land U=T[a:=\\beta]),\\\\\nT_A^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(\\langle\\neg A\\rangle,\\varnothing,\\langle\\rangle)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{SatTab}(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists U\\in\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\ (T\\Rightarrow U).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}procedure}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{PReady}(b)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)\\setminus E\\;\n\\neg\\exists B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n(\\Gamma(k)=(B\\land C)\\lor\\Gamma(k)=\\neg(B\\land C)\\lor\\Gamma(k)=\\neg\\neg B),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Rules}(b)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{\\langle b[\\langle B,C\\rangle;k]\\rangle\\mid\\Gamma(k)=B\\land C\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle b[\\langle\\neg B\\rangle;k],b[\\langle\\neg C\\rangle;k]\\rangle\\mid\\Gamma(k)=\\neg(B\\land C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle b[\\langle B\\rangle;k]\\rangle\\mid\\Gamma(k)=\\neg\\neg B\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle(\\Gamma,E\\cup\\{k\\},\\mathcal U\\mathbin{\\frown}\n\\langle\\langle(\\sigma(C,b),\\varnothing,\\langle\\rangle)\\rangle\\rangle)\\rangle\n\\mid\\Gamma(k)=\\neg\\Box C\\land\\mathsf{PReady}(b)\\},\\\\\nT\\Rightarrow U&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists a\\in\\mathsf{Br}(T)\\ \\exists\\beta\\in\\mathsf{Rules}(T|a)\\\n(\\mathsf{Open}(T|a)\\land U=T[a:=\\beta]),\\\\\nT_A^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(\\langle\\neg A\\rangle,\\varnothing,\\langle\\rangle)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{SatTab}(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists U\\in\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\ (T\\Rightarrow U).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 10 章 pp.141–143（编码及确定调度为本目录规约）。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>集合构造中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 统一遍历 Hypothesis 的未检查位置，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C\">\\(B,C\\)</span> 遍历公式集。规则是元层的有限树重写；不是额外的 GL 对象语言公理。</p>\n<p>固定有效公式树编码，在每个非终止状态先选命题规则，再选模态规则，同类中取最小地址及最小位置。这给出确定的饱和策略。新窗口内先处理命题联结词；闭分支不再展开。原书 pp.139、142 先作命题展开，再作模态展开；这里将本分支的命题优先条件正式写入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PReady}\">\\(\\mathsf{PReady}\\)</span>，采用一个明确的饱和策略。</p>\n<p>复制分支时同时复制窗口记录和已检查位置；出现地址重新按当前树排序。命题字母、负字母、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\neg\\bot\">\\(\\bot,\\neg\\bot\\)</span>、正盒均无展开规则。生成的每个正盒属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PReady}(b)\">\\(\\mathsf{PReady}(b)\\)</span> 仅表示本分支的三个命题规则已全部处理；字母、负字母、底及正盒不要求检查标记。首次建窗口以后，父分支不再增加公式，后续模态步只改变检查集及窗口序列，所以每个窗口继承的正盒清单就是父分支的最终正盒清单。不能只在 Remark 规定策略却让 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow\">\\(\\Rightarrow\\)</span> 允许任意顺序；去掉该守卫的明确反例见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cdecf2529365d61b\" href=\"?note=cdecf2529365d61b\" title=\"89-ex-gl-tableau-order\">89-ex-gl-tableau-order</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"b0e5598f570a6835","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-subformula","status":"resolved","id":"71b4f56d6213ff7c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-ex-gl-tableau-order","status":"resolved","id":"cdecf2529365d61b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PReady}(b)$ 仅表示本分支的三个命题规则已全部处理；字母、负字母、底及正盒不要求检查标记。首次建窗口以后，父分支不再增加公式，后续模态步只改变检查集及窗口序列，所以每个窗口继承的正盒清单就是父分支的最终正盒清单。不能只在 Remark 规定策略却让 $\\Rightarrow$ 允许任意顺序；去掉该守卫的明确反例见 [[89-ex-gl-tableau-order]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"T,U","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"b=(\\Gamma,E,\\mathcal U)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)\\setminus E","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\mathbin{\\frown}s","display":false},{"tex":"b[s;k]=(\\Gamma\\mathbin{\\frown}s,E\\cup\\{k\\},\\mathcal U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec D_b","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box D","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma(C,b)=\\langle\\neg C,\\Box C\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle D,\\Box D\\mid D\\in\\vec D_b\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Br}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle j\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle j,u\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}a","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathsf{Br}(\\mathcal U_j(u))","display":false},{"tex":"T|a","display":false},{"tex":"T[a:=\\beta]","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}procedure}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{PReady}(b)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)\\setminus E\\;\n\\neg\\exists B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n(\\Gamma(k)=(B\\land C)\\lor\\Gamma(k)=\\neg(B\\land C)\\lor\\Gamma(k)=\\neg\\neg B),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Rules}(b)\\coloneqq{}&\n\\{\\langle b[\\langle B,C\\rangle;k]\\rangle\\mid\\Gamma(k)=B\\land C\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\langle b[\\langle\\neg B\\rangle;k],b[\\langle\\neg C\\rangle;k]\\rangle\\mid\\Gamma(k)=\\neg(B\\land C)\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\langle b[\\langle B\\rangle;k]\\rangle\\mid\\Gamma(k)=\\neg\\neg B\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\langle(\\Gamma,E\\cup\\{k\\},\\mathcal U\\mathbin{\\frown}\n\\langle\\langle(\\sigma(C,b),\\varnothing,\\langle\\rangle)\\rangle\\rangle)\\rangle\n\\mid\\Gamma(k)=\\neg\\Box C\\land\\mathsf{PReady}(b)\\},\\\\\nT\\Rightarrow U&\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists a\\in\\mathsf{Br}(T)\\ \\exists\\beta\\in\\mathsf{Rules}(T|a)\\\n(\\mathsf{Open}(T|a)\\land U=T[a:=\\beta]),\\\\\nT_A^0&\\coloneqq\\langle(\\langle\\neg A\\rangle,\\varnothing,\\langle\\rangle)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{SatTab}(T)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists U\\in\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\ (T\\Rightarrow U).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"B,C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PReady}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot,\\neg\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PReady}(b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow","display":false}],"bytes":3869,"backlinks":[{"id":"cdecf2529365d61b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b271bf5e7002b205","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84ff5236d2f50db8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fb687bda8415ad17","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tableau-procedure]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tableau]] → [[89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-window]] → [[89-df-gl-tableau-procedure]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-termination]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-closed-soundness]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel]] → [[89-thm-gl-tableau-decision]]"}],"outgoing":["b0e5598f570a6835","71b4f56d6213ff7c","cdecf2529365d61b"]}